CREATIVE COMMONS PUBLIC DOMAIN DEDICATION

The person or persons who have associated work with this deed (the
"Dedicator" or "Certifier") hereby dedicate the entire copyright and
related and neighboring rights throughout the world associated with this
work to the public domain. This dedication is intended to extend to all
copyright and related and neighboring rights anywhere in the world that
relate to this work, including, without limitation, all economic rights
and neighboring rights. To the extent possible under law, Dedicator
hereby waives and relinquishes all such rights in this work and dedicates
such rights to the public domain, for use throughout the world as
permitted by law, without any conditions or restrictions, whether
expressly stated in this deed or implied.

Dedicator makes the dedication for the benefit of the public at large and
to the detriment of Dedicator's heirs and successors. Dedicator
understands that such relinquishment of rights means that Dedicator, to
the extent permitted by law, retains no rights in this work and cannot
prevent others from using, modifying, distributing, or otherwise
exploiting this work, in any form, whether commercial or non-commercial,
and in any way, including by methods that have not yet been invented or
conceived.

Dedicator makes the dedication with full knowledge and understanding that
this work may be subject to patent rights or other intellectual property
rights owned by third parties, and that the work may be subject to use
restrictions in certain jurisdictions. Dedicator will not assert any
rights in the work and will not hold any party liable for any use of the
work, to the fullest extent permitted by law, without regard to any
patent or other intellectual property rights owned by third parties that
may be affected by the work.

